
# Assignment 5 - Employee Registration System

## Scenario
A script that registers a new employee by collecting their details and displaying them back in the terminal.

## File
- employee.sh

## How to Run
chmod +x employee.sh
./employee.sh

## What It Does
The script prompts the user to enter:
- Employee Name
- Age
- Department
- Salary

Then it prints all the entered information back to the terminal in a formatted report.

## Example
Enter Employee Name: Alyaa
Enter Age: 22
Enter Department: IT
Enter Salary: 8000

===== Employee Registration Details =====
Name       : Alyaa
Age        : 22
Department : IT
Salary     : 8000
===========================================

## Concepts Used
- read -p for interactive user input
- Variables to store user input
- echo for formatted output display
